    "Description": "Perl is a high-level programming language that is commonly used for system administration utilities and web programming.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* perl: Perl threads have a working directory race condition where file operations may target unintended paths (CVE-2025-40909)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
